1
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:07,140
妈 那狗又在吠
Mom. The dog again.

2
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:10,120
听到了 宝贝 我想掐死那条疯老狗
I know baby. I want to strangle that crazy old thing.

3
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,120
别理它就是了
Just ignore it.

4
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,440
对你来说确实容易
It's easy for you to ignore

5
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,000
因为你已经老耳闭塞
because you have the old-man hearing.

6
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:16,180
但是我跟曼尼有着朝气蓬勃的双耳
But Manny and I -- we have the young ears.

7
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,520
我就不明白你怎么会受不了一条咆哮狗
I don't get how one dog keeps you awake

8
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:19,920
你老家满街都是斗鸡和武装革命
when you grew up sleeping through

9
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:20,936
应该早习惯了吧
cockfights and revolutions.

10
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,220
很好笑 杰
Mm-hmm. Very funny, Jay.

11
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,720
曼尼已经好几个礼拜都没睡好觉了
Manny hasn't been able to sleep in weeks.

12
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,680
他都没精神上课
It's screwing his brain for school.

13
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:28,720
那狗吠个不停
And it doesn't stop.

14
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:31,226
一直不停地叫啊叫啊叫啊叫啊叫啊叫啊
It goes on and on and on and on and on and on

15
00:00:31,256 --> 00:00:34,502
-叫啊叫啊 -行了 这声挺烦的
- and on and on and on. - Yes, that could be annoying.

16
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,000
我受够了 我去找他们
That's it. I'm going over there.

17
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,280
歌洛莉亚 别惹事
Gloria, now, don't go starting something

18
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,020
因为不管你干什么 最后还不是我善后
because whenever you do, I'm the one that --

19
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,660
这声她倒是可以不理会
That she couldn't hear.

20
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:48,500
他们都不见了 小卡
They're gone. Cam.

21
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:50,220
所有的小孩都不见了
All the children are gone.

22
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,060
什么孩子们
What children?

23
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:52,380
我在公园跑步
I was running in the park,

24
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,100
然后我发现
and I noticed that none of the kids

25
00:00:54,100 --> 00:00:55,460
跟莉莉一起玩的小孩都不见了
Lily usually plays with were there.

26
00:00:55,560 --> 00:00:57,580
-现在还早着呢 -但是我遇到了罗莉
- Well, it's still early. - But then I ran into Lori.

27
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,400
大胸罗莉还是牙套罗莉
Boobs Lori or adult-braces Lori?

28
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,040
-美鞋罗莉 -我喜欢她
- Great-shoes Lori. - Oh, I like her.

29
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:03,140
她说他们都把孩子送去上幼儿园了
And she said that they all sent their kids to preschool.

30
00:01:03,580 --> 00:01:06,080
什么 我们说好了明年再上的
What?! We agreed to wait till next year.

31
00:01:06,340 --> 00:01:08,960
那是忽悠我们 好给自家孩子争取名额
It was a fake-out to make sure that their kids got a spot.

32
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:10,920
那些瘦婊子
Those skinny bitches.

33
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,572
我们必须去报名 卡梅隆
We have got to get her into school, Cameron,

34
00:01:12,572 --> 00:01:13,780
不然她就落后了
or else she's gonna fall behind.

35
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:15,140
你以为我不知道吗
Don't you think I know that?

36
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,060
真够绝的
This is perfect.

37
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:17,260
让那对基佬
Oh, leave it to the gays

38
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:19,440
养出美利坚唯一一个成绩烂的亚洲小孩吧
to raise the only underachieving Asian in America.

39
00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,800
好了 这个给你
Okay, here you go.

40
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:26,220
伙计们 吃早餐了
Guys, breakfast.

41
00:01:26,241 --> 00:01:28,569
伙计们 菲尔 理我一下
Guys. Phil. Hello.

42
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:29,600
我在我在
Totally with you.

43
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,460
孩子们 盘子放到洗碗机里去
Kids, put your dishes in the dishwasher.

44
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,560
好了 我受够了
Okay, no. That's it.

45
00:01:32,680 --> 00:01:34,580
每个人都给老娘把手里的玩意儿放下
Everybody, gadgets down now!

46
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:36,180
你干嘛发飙
Why are you freaking out?

47
00:01:36,224 --> 00:01:38,387
因为这些玩意把你们魂都勾跑了
Because you're all so involved with your little gizmos,

48
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:39,800
都没人讲话了
nobody is even talking.

49
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:41,560
家人彼此间应该交流
Families are supposed to talk.

50
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:43,780
你在处理什么了不得的事吗
What are you doing that's so important?

51
00:01:43,780 --> 00:01:45,340
我在捣鼓俺的梦幻烤炉
Oh, I'm locking in my fantasy roster.

52
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,120
我战无不胜
I'm unbeatable.

53
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,713
我们正要建一个地上泳池
We're totally getting an aboveground pool.

54
00:01:49,100 --> 00:01:50,460
去死吧 蠢货 去死吧
Die, stupid, die!

55
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,320
卢克 我叫你把那东西放下
Luke, I told you to put that down now.

56
00:01:52,340 --> 00:01:52,720
快点 小子
Come on, buddy.

57
00:01:52,740 --> 00:01:54,900
等一下 我就要破老爸的记录了
One second. I'm about to beat dad's record.

58
00:01:55,020 --> 00:01:56,020
听妈妈的话
You heard your mother.

59
00:01:57,460 --> 00:01:59,340
有什么这么好笑
What is so funny?

60
00:01:59,371 --> 00:02:00,375
没什么
Nothing.

61
00:02:00,592 --> 00:02:03,179
"老妈疯了" 谢谢 海莉
"Mom's insane." Thank you, Haley.

62
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,160
至少我们在交流
At least we talk.

63
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:06,100
喂
Hello.

64
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,460
是我 哪所幼儿园比较好
Hey, it's me. What's a good preschool?

65
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:11,014
我家小孩去的是沃根威尔
Uh, well, our kids went to Wagon Wheel.

66
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:12,420
那所好吗 你喜欢吗
And it was good? You liked it?

67
00:02:12,453 --> 00:02:13,252
你知道我的小孩
Oh, well, you know my kids

68
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:15,080
反正也都不是什么太好的胚子
are middle-management material at best.

69
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:16,120
也不想在他们身上浪费太多钱
Didn't want to waste a lot of money --

70
00:02:16,340 --> 00:02:18,000
米奇尔 那所不赖
Yes, Mitchell, it's good.

71
00:02:18,220 --> 00:02:19,060
干吗突然问这个
Why the interest?

72
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:20,680
我突然发现莉莉的玩伴们
I just realized that all of Lily's friends

73
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:23,280
今年都上幼儿园了 她现在落后了
are going to school this year, and now she's late.

74
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:24,840
别担心 她可以明年再上
Don't worry. She can wait another year.

75
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:26,860
给她买部黑莓手机就是了
Just buy her a Blackberry,

76
00:02:26,902 --> 00:02:28,588
反正现在的小孩就爱它
that's all she's gonna want to do anyway.

77
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:29,540
她说什么
What did she say?

78
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:30,920
她说给莉莉买部黑莓手机
She says to buy her a Blackberry.

79
00:02:31,100 --> 00:02:33,240
莉莉的小手还没法玩手机呢 克莱尔
Lily doesn't have the dexterity for that, Claire!

80
00:02:33,380 --> 00:02:34,520
她疯了吧
What is happening?

81
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:36,120
你能不能问一下你那间学校
Can you just check with your school

82
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,620
看看能不能接收我们
and see if maybe you can get us in?

83
00:02:37,651 --> 00:02:40,689
我也许可以帮你安排一次会面
Hmm. I-I can probably get you an interview.

84
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,320
太棒了 太好了
Oh, no. That's great. That's great.

85
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,880
谢谢 真的太感谢了
Thank you. I really appreciate it.

86
00:02:44,020 --> 00:02:45,160
还有 顺便问一下 你觉得
Oh, and, by the way, what do you think

87
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,920
比林斯利学院怎么样
of that place Billingsley Academy?

88
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:49,340
比林斯利 拽得很呢
Ooh. Billingsley. Very hoity-toity.

89
00:02:49,820 --> 00:02:51,860
一般人根本进不去 除非你富得流油
You can't get in there unless you're really rich

90
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:53,020
或者在校董会有人
or you know somebody on the board.

91
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:54,420
天啊 这简直是个噩梦
Oh, god, this is a nightmare.

92
00:02:54,860 --> 00:02:56,840
米奇 幼儿园罢了 别小题大做
Mitch, it's preschool. Don't overthink it.

93
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,060
我家小孩也没上比林斯利
My kids didn't go to Billingsley,

94
00:02:58,140 --> 00:02:59,600
他们不也好好的吗
and they are fine.

95
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:03,020
我得挂了
I have to go.

96
00:03:04,820 --> 00:03:05,340
菲尔
Phil.

97
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:08,780
有创意
That's awesome.

98
00:03:26,187 --> 00:03:28,155
-早上好 -你好
- Buenos dias. - Hi.

99
00:03:28,155 --> 00:03:29,500
我们还没正式见过面
We haven't formally met.

100
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:31,180
我是住在隔壁的歌洛莉亚·普里契特
I'm Gloria Pritchett from next door.

101
00:03:31,241 --> 00:03:33,420
我叫拉瑞·保森 见过面了
Larry Paulson. Yeah, I've seen you. Mm.

102
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:33,940
艳福不浅啊
Lucky guy.

103
00:03:34,100 --> 00:03:35,320
是福是祸你很快就知道了
Wait a minute, then tell me.

104
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,460
你的狗吠个不停
Your dog doesn't stop barking.

105
00:03:37,460 --> 00:03:39,340
整日整夜乱吠
All morning, all night.

106
00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:40,820
他吵醒了我儿子
He wakes my son up,

107
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:41,860
他需要充足的睡眠
and he needs his sleep.

108
00:03:41,898 --> 00:03:44,091
不是我的狗 是我即将散伙的妻子的
It's not my dog. It's my soon-to-be ex-wife's.

109
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,580
她三个星期前搬出去了
She moved out three weeks ago.

110
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:46,680
她会回来取吗
Is she coming back for it?

111
00:03:46,780 --> 00:03:48,460
除非狗屎变美钞
Not unless it starts crapping money.

112
00:03:48,580 --> 00:03:50,440
那你必须想办法治治它
Well, you need to do something about the dog.

113
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:52,040
那狗又老又笨
The dog is old and stupid.

114
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,820
你到底是在生谁的气 拉瑞
Who are you really mad at, Larry?

115
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,700
那条狗还是你妻子
The dog or your wife?

116
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,920
这小孩怎么回事
Who the hell is this kid?

117
00:03:56,981 --> 00:03:58,203
别扯上小孩
Hey, there's no need for that.

118
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,600
我告诉你他是怎么回事
I'll tell you who he is.

119
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:01,731
他的名字就叫做 让你那该死的狗闭嘴
His name is "shut up your damn dog"!

120
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,560
真是讽刺至极啊
You know what's ironic?

121
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:05,360
我从来都没有抱怨过
And I have never once said a word

122
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,080
你们家那只聒噪的鹦鹉
About that obnoxious parrot of yours

123
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,300
叫声简直非人类
That's always squawking.

124
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:09,060
鹦鹉
Parrot?

125
00:04:09,780 --> 00:04:10,560
什么鹦鹉
What parrot?

126
00:04:10,614 --> 00:04:11,409
杰
Jay!

127
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:12,118
杰
Jay!

128
00:04:12,161 --> 00:04:13,482
杰
Jay!

129
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:16,960
他那是什么意思 哪儿来的鹦鹉
What is he talking about? What parrot?

130
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:18,000
我怎么知道
How the hell do I know?

131
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:19,300
那我们现在应该怎么做
So, what do we do now?

132
00:04:19,339 --> 00:04:20,828
我们已经和他说了 还能做什么
Nothing. We did it. He heard us.

133
00:04:20,828 --> 00:04:22,259
但他什么都没听进去
He didn't hear nothing.

134
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:24,177
杰 别走 杰
Jay, don't go. Jay!

135
00:04:24,206 --> 00:04:26,504
杰 杰
Jay! Jay!

136
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:32,340
好了 我们召开这次家庭会议的原因是
Okay, we have called this family meeting

137
00:04:32,340 --> 00:04:35,060
个人电子产品已经影响了正常生活
Because the personal electronics have gotten out of control.

138
00:04:35,060 --> 00:04:37,256
从今天起 将进行为期一周的电子设备禁用周
Starting today, there's going to be a one-week ban

139
00:04:37,256 --> 00:04:39,379
-禁止用手机 发信息 -噢不
-On all cellphones, texting, -oh!

140
00:04:39,379 --> 00:04:42,220
禁止上论坛 视屏聊天 玩游戏
Im'ing, video chatting, video-gaming,

141
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:44,520
-禁止任何网络行为 -那我该怎么做作业
-Anything on the internet. -How am I supposed to do my homework?

142
00:04:44,660 --> 00:04:45,520
跟我学学
The way I did.

143
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,060
拿一个凿子和一块石头
With a chisel and a piece of stone.

144
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:48,620
-菲尔 -别想阻止我发自内心的幽默感
-Phil. -Can't unplug my funny bone.

145
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:51,160
我马上就要完成一份科学论文
I have a huge science paper due.

146
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:53,780
别担心 也许家里还有本祖传的百科全书
And we have a great set of encyclopedias...Somewhere.

147
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:55,920
不然你认为公共图书馆是用来干吗
What do you think the public library is for?

148
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:58,580
我以为那里是流浪汉的免费公厕
I thought that was a bathroom for homeless people.

149
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:01,480
我还能继续玩植物大战僵尸吗
Can I still play plants vs. Zombies?

150
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:02,580
你是不是聋了
Are you not listening?

151
00:05:02,621 --> 00:05:05,286
-但是你了解植物 -怎么
-But you learn about plants. -Mm-hmm.

152
00:05:05,300 --> 00:05:06,440
植物是有生命的
And plants are life.

153
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,540
难道你反对生命吗
Are you against life?

154
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:10,780
那我该怎么和我的朋友聊天
How am I supposed to talk to my friends?

155
00:05:10,940 --> 00:05:12,080
在学校聊个痛快
Talk to them at school.

156
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:13,220
或者在果汁店
Or at a juice bar.

157
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,760
或者用座机打
Or on the house phone.

158
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,800
没人知道我们家的号码
Nobody even knows our number.

159
00:05:15,900 --> 00:05:17,020
连我自己都不知道
I don't even know our number.

160
00:05:17,020 --> 00:05:18,600
这么说老爸也不会再去上网咯
So, you're saying dad's not going to go online?

161
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:19,720
-当然 -老爸
-Yep. -Dad?

162
00:05:19,900 --> 00:05:21,480
-是的 -那疯狂足球怎么办
-That's right. -What about fantasy football?

163
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,580
不用担心 球队那边已经都安排好了
Not a problem. My team's set this week.

164
00:05:23,940 --> 00:05:25,160
我至死不渝地
I am completely on board

165
00:05:25,189 --> 00:05:26,825
支持你老妈的突发奇想
your mother's horse and buggy to yesteryear.

166
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:29,320
接下来的一周 我要回归原始社会
For the next week, I may as well be Amish.

167
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:30,800
原始人邓菲
Jebediah Dunphy.

168
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,323
穴居狩猎 茹毛饮血
Raising barns, witnessing murders,

169
00:05:32,323 --> 00:05:34,184
钻木取火
Making electric fireplace hearths.

170
00:05:34,215 --> 00:05:36,552
这简直太不公平了
Oh! This is so unfair!

171
00:05:36,700 --> 00:05:37,440
你猜怎么着
You know what?

172
00:05:37,722 --> 00:05:39,417
我们可以搞得有趣些
We're gonna make this fun.

173
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,520
把它当作一次比赛
Turn it into a game.

174
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,820
坚持到最后的那个人就是胜利者
Whoever stays unplugged the longest, wins.

175
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:44,060
菲尔 这不是我的初衷
Not what I had in mind, Phil.

176
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,480
-我们能赢得什么 -你们想要什么
-What do we win? -What do you want?

177
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,480
我想要一台新电脑
I want a new computer.

178
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:47,080
成
Done

179
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:49,140
我们禁止他们用电子产品
We're gonna get them off of electronics

180
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:50,940
结果却要给他们添置更多电子设备吗
with the promise of more electronics?

181
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:53,349
-我想要鸡肉馅饼 -整只鸡都行
-I want chicken pot pie. -And chicken.

182
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,080
我想要一辆车
I want a car.

183
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,520
-没门 -成
-No way! -Done!

184
00:05:55,555 --> 00:05:56,825
我能有自己的车了
Yeah, I'm getting a car!

185
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:58,960
-没错 很有趣 对吧 -菲尔
-Yeah, fun, right? -Phil!

186
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,540
我们养不起第三辆车
We cannot afford a third car.

187
00:06:00,573 --> 00:06:03,080
别担心 他们不可能赢我们
Relax. They're never gonna last as long as us.

188
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:06,080
亲爱的 别误会
Oh, honey, don't take this the wrong way,

189
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:08,360
但我确实对你没有任何信心
but I have almost no faith in you.

190
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:15,580
乔安妮马上就会出来
Joanie will be right out.

191
00:06:15,660 --> 00:06:17,100
她马上就会结束那个接见
She's just finishing up another interview.

192
00:06:17,100 --> 00:06:18,246
好的 谢谢 谢谢 谢谢
Okay. Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.

193
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:19,900
-不客气 -我真心喜欢这个地方
- You're welcome. - I really like this place.

194
00:06:19,980 --> 00:06:21,480
-看看这些画 -我看到了
- Look at all these drawings. - I know.

195
00:06:21,500 --> 00:06:23,220
你看到院子里的鸭鸭了吗
And did you see the duckies in the yard?

196
00:06:23,220 --> 00:06:24,581
-莉莉最喜欢鸭鸭了 -我知道
- Lily loves duckies. - I know.

197
00:06:24,581 --> 00:06:25,375
我等会要提到这些
I'm gonna mention that.

198
00:06:25,375 --> 00:06:26,220
行啊 说啊
Okay, well, do,

199
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:29,220
搞的好像说这个就能让她显得与众不同似的
because that's really gonna set her apart from the rest of the kids.

200
00:06:29,260 --> 00:06:30,120
我们还要提到
We should also mention

201
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:32,080
当我们看克莱尔· 罗斯的 脱口秀时 她总是很兴奋
how she always perks up when we watch "Charlie Rose."

202
00:06:32,340 --> 00:06:34,260
就一次而已 因为当时他在采访艾摩
That was one time. He was interviewing Elmo.

203
00:06:35,060 --> 00:06:36,620
你们放轻松点
You boys ought to relax.

204
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:37,920
对不起
Oh, I'm sorry.

205
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:40,200
-我们只是想留下一个好印象 -对的
- We just -- we really want to make a good impression. - Mm.

206
00:06:41,060 --> 00:06:43,280
基佬养父母加上一个外籍宝宝
Gay adoptive parents with a minority baby?

207
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:46,220
学校随你们挑
Sugars, you can get into any school you want.

208
00:06:46,220 --> 00:06:48,125
什么 真的吗
What was that? Really?

209
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,440
你们不知道吗
Oh, you didn't know that?

210
00:06:49,740 --> 00:06:50,840
当然
oh, yeah.

211
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:53,680
所有的学校都爱吹嘘自己没有任何歧视
All of these schools like to brag about their diversity.

212
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,560
你们简直是神奇三侠啊
You're diverse times three.

213
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,460
绝对供不应求
In demand.

214
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,540
你们简直就像热卖的音乐会门票
You're like Jimmy Buffett tickets

215
00:06:58,540 --> 00:07:00,740
那些非同白人完全不是你们的对手
to these hybrid-driving, straight white folks.

216
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,060
多谢夸奖 小妞
I hear that, girl.

217
00:07:04,220 --> 00:07:04,660
好吧
Yeah.

218
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,400
我来啦 别急
I'm coming!

219
00:07:13,159 --> 00:07:14,620
我家的狗在哪
Where the hell is the dog?

220
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:16,140
-是谁在敲门 -我们的邻居
-Who is it? -It's our neighbor.

221
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:17,260
我家的狗不见了
The dog is gone.

222
00:07:17,660 --> 00:07:18,560
也许它自个跑走了
Maybe it ran away.

223
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:19,780
有链子锁着呢 怎么跑
It was chained to a tree.

224
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:21,160
也许你老婆带走了
Maybe your wife took it.

225
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:23,320
根据我的信用卡账单 我老婆人在欧洲
According to my credit card, my wife is in europe,

226
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:25,200
正在搜寻最豪华的酒店
searching for the world's most expensive hotel.

227
00:07:25,300 --> 00:07:26,360
那关我们什么事
Then what do you want from us?

228
00:07:26,380 --> 00:07:27,920
你来我家抱怨狗吵
You come over complaining about the dog

229
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,900
然后第二天我家的狗就不见了
And the next day it's gone?

230
00:07:29,020 --> 00:07:29,780
你说我来干什么
You tell me.

231
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,560
-我会... -居然敢来这里撒野
-I'll tell -- -how dare you?

232
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:35,120
你到我们家来 把我们家的门铃都要按爆了
You come to our house, you ring our bell many times,

233
00:07:35,120 --> 00:07:37,480
还指责我们绑了你的狗
And you accuse us of taking your dog.

234
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,300
慢走不送
You should go home.

235
00:07:38,380 --> 00:07:40,360
-这事还没完呢 -不 已经说的很清楚了
-We're not done here. -Yes, we are.

236
00:07:41,620 --> 00:07:43,080
你到底做了什么
What did you do?

237
00:07:43,340 --> 00:07:44,460
你肯定不想知道的
You don't want to know.

238
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:48,280
歌洛莉亚的祖父和叔叔们都是屠夫
Gloria's grandfather and uncles were butchers,

239
00:07:48,280 --> 00:07:50,120
所以一说到杀戮
so she's always had a certain comfort level

240
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:52,720
她总是习以为常
when it comes to...Killing.

241
00:07:54,500 --> 00:07:55,720
有一次 我们家闹耗子
One time, we had this rat...

242
00:07:55,765 --> 00:07:58,480
首先拍烂它
What? First you smash it,

243
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,760
然后砍断鼠头
then you cut the head off.

244
00:08:00,460 --> 00:08:01,640
她就像孙二娘转世
It was like nothing to her.

245
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:03,780
我要去教堂了
I go to church now.

246
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:06,220
她把鼠头留在那儿
She left the head out there

247
00:08:06,220 --> 00:08:07,780
杀一儆百
To send a message to the other rats.

248
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,500
-嗨 -嗨 亲爱的
- Hey. - Hi, honey.

249
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,340
今天工作顺利不
How was your day at work?

250
00:08:11,340 --> 00:08:13,000
棒极了
Amazing. Mwah.

251
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:13,980
哇 说说看
Great. What happened?

252
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:16,300
没有像平常那样 把午休时间浪费在上网啊
Instead of wasting my lunch hour surfing the web,

253
00:08:16,300 --> 00:08:17,580
查足球动态啊之类的
checking football stats,

254
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,180
今天我在舒缓的音乐伴奏下
I put on some mellow music,

255
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:20,280
冥思静想
and I meditated.

256
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,960
哇 坚持了多久
Wow. For how long?

257
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:24,260
我也不知多久 反正我二十分钟前刚醒
I have no idea. I just woke up 20 minutes ago.

258
00:08:24,860 --> 00:08:25,380
妈
Hey, mom.

259
00:08:25,540 --> 00:08:29,320
我们美术课作业要用一块肥皂和一根黑色马克笔
I need a bar of soap and a black marker for an art project.

260
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,300
好的 马克笔在那儿
Okay. Well, the marker's over there,

261
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:33,140
肥皂在水池下面
and the soap is under the sink.

262
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:35,860
你看只要你不沉迷于网络
Isn't it great how much time you have

263
00:08:35,860 --> 00:08:37,240
就能省出大把时间啊
now that you're not wasting it online?

264
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:39,540
老天 你一直都这么说话吗
Oh, my god. Is this what you always sound like?

265
00:08:39,860 --> 00:08:43,225
老爸 看看我建了什么 邓菲之塔
Look what I built, dad. Dunphy towers.

266
00:08:43,489 --> 00:08:47,207
二百间公寓 每间都住了一个幸福的家庭
200 condos, a happy family in every one.

267
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,340
不错啊 小伙
Way to go, buddy.

268
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,320
亲爱的 我真佩服你
I got to hand it to you, honey.

269
00:08:50,380 --> 00:08:51,900
24小时没玩游戏
24 hours without video games,

270
00:08:51,900 --> 00:08:53,740
他都开始造福社会了
he's already contributing to society.

271
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:54,960
去死吧 去死吧
Die! Die!

272
00:08:56,780 --> 00:08:58,620
老师说 他已经分不清梦境和现实了
To be fair, he's using his imagination.

273
00:08:58,620 --> 00:09:00,720
没有安全出口
There's no fire escapes!

274
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,680
他们抄近路了
They cut corners!

275
00:09:01,900 --> 00:09:02,980
我来灭了你们
I'll cut your corners!

276
00:09:08,220 --> 00:09:08,780
喂
Hello?

277
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:11,480
哦 嗨 卢克小宝贝 找你的
Oh, hi. Luke, honey, it's for you.

278
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:13,080
嗨 格里芬 你好吗
Hi, Griffin. How are you?

279
00:09:13,580 --> 00:09:15,100
嗯 他在这儿 稍等
Yeah, he's right here. Hold on.

280
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:17,320
喂 格里芬
Hey, Griffin.

281
00:09:19,380 --> 00:09:21,760
-哦 天哪 -怎么了
- Oh, my God! - What happened?

282
00:09:22,260 --> 00:09:24,720
Youtube上有个驴在水上滑翔的视频
There's a parasailing-donkey video on Youtube.

283
00:09:24,900 --> 00:09:26,140
哦 天哪
Oh, my god!

284
00:09:26,140 --> 00:09:28,140
等等 卢克 比赛怎么办
Wait, Luke. What about the contest?

285
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:29,180
我退出
I quit.

286
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,460
我可不是石头人
I'm not made of stone, you know.

287
00:09:31,511 --> 00:09:33,392
恶 难以置信
Uhh! I can't believe it.

288
00:09:33,422 --> 00:09:35,919
我论文居然拿了个"B"
I got a "B" on my paper.

289
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,960
-恭喜 -不错哦
- Good for you. - Yeah.

290
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,400
不 对你们来说可能不错
No, it would be good for you.

291
00:09:38,580 --> 00:09:39,940
对我简直糟糕透顶
It's terrible for me.

292
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:42,000
多谢你那发了霉的百科全书
Thanks to your moldy encyclopedias,

293
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:45,260
我对有丝分裂的描述完全过时了
my take on mitosis was completely out of date.

294
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:47,340
甚至都没人用原生质这种说法了
They don't even call it protoplasm anymore.

295
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:48,600
现在都叫细胞质
It's cytoplasm.

296
00:09:49,020 --> 00:09:50,740
你可以问我们的呀
Well, you could have asked one of us.

297
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,220
你在搞笑吗
Now you're making jokes?

298
00:09:52,260 --> 00:09:53,920
-我没在搞笑 -真的吗
- I'm not making a joke. - Really?

299
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:56,740
生殖细胞和受精卵的区别是什么
What's the difference between a gamete and a zygote?

300
00:09:58,700 --> 00:09:59,800
别上当 克莱尔
Don't fall for it, Claire.

301
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:01,160
她瞎编了俩单词
She's just making up words.

302
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:02,840
够了
That's it.

303
00:10:02,860 --> 00:10:03,800
我需要因特网
I need the internet.

304
00:10:04,060 --> 00:10:05,820
我退出你们的烂比赛
I'm out of your stupid contest.

305
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:14,880
三强争霸
And then there were three.

306
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:23,000
她杀气十足
She's kind of scary.

307
00:10:23,460 --> 00:10:26,340
我们才不会给她买车
We're not buying her a car.

308
00:10:29,940 --> 00:10:31,220
小伙儿 看啥呢
Hey, buddy, what you reading?

309
00:10:31,740 --> 00:10:32,700
《老人与海》
"The old man and the sea."

310
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:34,960
喜欢吗
You like it?

311
00:10:35,017 --> 00:10:36,966
我喜欢海明威的开门见山
I like that Hemingway gets to the point.

312
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,040
你读过他另外的作品啊
You read a lot of his stuff?

313
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:39,980
我是在暗示你有话就说 杰
That was a hint, Jay.

314
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,080
哦 明白
Oh, okay.

315
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:45,300
我想问你点事
I want to ask you something...

316
00:10:45,300 --> 00:10:46,560
天知地知 你知我知
between you and me.

317
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,560
你想知道我妈有没有
You want to know if I think my mom

318
00:10:48,560 --> 00:10:49,720
对那狗下毒手
did something to that dog.

319
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:52,000
-对 -坐
- Yeah. - Sit.

320
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,160
小孩一般都喝汽水的吧
Don't most kids drink soda?

321
00:10:56,380 --> 00:10:58,440
谁管他们喝什么
Who knows what they do?

322
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,440
回归正题
So, your mom.

323
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:04,540
杰 这十二年来我学会了几件事
Jay, I've learned a few things in my 12 years.

324
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:06,380
亚麻衣服别买地摊货
Don't skimp on linens,

325
00:11:06,419 --> 00:11:09,588
千万不要赞美老师的身材
don't compliment a teacher on her figure,

326
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:11,040
至于我妈
and when it comes to my mom,

327
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:13,440
有些问题你还是别问了 我也不想知道答案
never ask questions I don't want the answers to.

328
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:16,220
我才不信 你这么敏感的小孩儿
I don't buy it. Sensitive kid like you.

329
00:11:16,220 --> 00:11:18,420
肯定跟我一样 有打破沙锅探到底的精神
I think you want to know every bit as much as I do.

330
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:19,440
你错了
You're wrong.

331
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:22,207
那你手怎么发抖了
Then why is your hand shaking?

332
00:11:22,260 --> 00:11:23,840
这是我今天第五杯咖啡
This is my fifth one of these today.

333
00:11:24,180 --> 00:11:25,500
我可能咖啡喝太多了
I may have a problem.

334
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:26,740
好吧 别喝了
Okay. That's enough.

335
00:11:27,425 --> 00:11:31,209
不不不 明天下午四点非常好
No, no, no, 4:00 tomorrow is fine.

336
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:33,540
好的 那么我和我的伴侣与您到时见
Yeah, my life partner and I will see you then.

337
00:11:33,572 --> 00:11:34,868
谢谢您
Thank -- thank you.

338
00:11:34,900 --> 00:11:36,840
什么时候起你开始管我叫伴侣了
Since when do you call me your life partner?

339
00:11:36,877 --> 00:11:39,192
从我们拿到了比林斯利学园的面试名额起
Since a spot opened up at Billingsley Academy.

340
00:11:39,220 --> 00:11:42,020
但我喜欢沃根威尔 那里有好多小鸭鸭
But I liked Wagon Wheel. It had all the duckies.

341
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:44,120
这让我回忆起我在密苏里童年时光
And it reminded me of where I went in Missouri.

342
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:47,060
小卡 比林斯利可不是浪得虚名
Cam, everyone goes to Billingsley for a reason --

343
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,560
它就相当于学前班中的哈佛
It's the Harvard of preschools.

344
00:11:48,590 --> 00:11:50,550
她还不到两岁呢
She's not even 2 years old yet.

345
00:11:50,580 --> 00:11:52,960
她不需要什么哈佛学前班
She doesn't need the Harvard of Preschools.

346
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:55,420
她需要的是手指画和小鸭鸭
She needs finger painting and duckies.

347
00:11:55,580 --> 00:11:57,280
我求你了 你就不能说"鸭子"吗
I'm begging you to please just say "Ducks."

348
00:11:59,000 --> 00:11:59,520
喂
Hello?

349
00:12:00,340 --> 00:12:02,340
好消息 沃根威尔很欣赏你们
Great news. Wagon Wheel loved you.

350
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:03,920
-你们进了 -哦
- You're in. - Oh.

351
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,180
沃根威尔要咱们
Wagon Wheel wants us.

352
00:12:05,201 --> 00:12:06,414
哦 太棒了
Oh, yes!

353
00:12:06,455 --> 00:12:07,720
这真是个好消息
Okay. Well, that's great and everything,

354
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,680
不过我们明天还要去赶另一个入学面试
but actually we have an appointment tomorrow

355
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:10,840
-比林斯利小学 -真的吗
- At Billingsley. - Really?

356
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:13,800
没错 显然我们很抢手
Yeah, apparently we are in very high demand.

357
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:16,680
只是要你知道 我觉得沃根威尔
Oh, well, just so you know, I don't think Wagon Wheel

358
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:18,502
不会给你们当备胎
is gonna hold a place for you.

359
00:12:18,544 --> 00:12:20,189
我觉得我们这回得碰碰运气
Well, I think we're gonna take our chance.

360
00:12:20,220 --> 00:12:21,580
碰运气 听起来真不靠谱
Take our chance? That sounds chancy.

361
00:12:21,820 --> 00:12:22,500
米奇尔
You know, Mitchell,

362
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:24,340
是你惊慌失措地给我打电话
you were the one who called me in a panic.

363
00:12:24,540 --> 00:12:26,680
是你叫我帮忙报上名
You were the one who needed me to get you in.

364
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:27,820
我很抱歉 克莱尔
I'm sorry, Claire.

365
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,860
我不是有意麻烦你的
I didn't mean to put you out.

366
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:30,340
但你也别说得这么夸张
But let's not get too dramatic here.

367
00:12:30,340 --> 00:12:31,527
不过就是写了封邮件而已
You wrote an e-mail.

368
00:12:31,527 --> 00:12:32,919
这不是封邮件
It wasn't an e-mail.

369
00:12:32,919 --> 00:12:36,161
是一通有线电话
It was a phone call from a land line.

370
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:40,020
你做了什么
What did you do?

371
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,980
-是为莉莉好 -是吗
- What's best for Lily. - Did you?

372
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,920
小卡 这是我们作为基佬头一回
Cam, this is the first time that being gay

373
00:12:43,920 --> 00:12:45,120
享受到竞争优势
is a competitive advantage.

374
00:12:45,340 --> 00:12:47,000
他们体操班正在招人
They're choosing teams for gym class,

375
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,660
我们终于能首批入选
and we're finally getting picked first.

376
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:49,700
我一直都是最先被选上
I always got picked first.

377
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,380
因为我能用躲避球砸穿一层夹板
I could throw a dodgeball through a piece of plywood.

378
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:53,400
不过我懂你意思
But I see your point.

379
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:20,700
别像鬼一样靠近我
Don't sneak up on me like that.

380
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:22,240
你出来这儿干什么
What are you doing out here?

381
00:13:22,275 --> 00:13:24,902
你来问我妈的事搞得我头都大了
You got in my head about my mom.

382
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:25,960
这就是杀鼠之铲吗
Is that the rat shovel?

383
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:27,460
没错
Yeah.

384
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,940
你在找狗狗的线索吗
Are you checking it for signs of dog?

385
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:30,920
我正准备检查
I was going to.

386
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:32,980
我们速战速决
Well, let's do this quick.

387
00:13:33,220 --> 00:13:34,200
要是被她抓住的话
If she catches us,

388
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:36,634
我们就跟这狗一样死定了
we're as dead as that dog probably is.

389
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:42,040
-你们在这儿干嘛呢 -什么也没干
- What are you doing here? - Nothing.

390
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:43,820
你们干嘛看这个铲子
Why are you looking at that shovel?

391
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:45,800
你觉得有人
Do you think someone

392
00:13:45,800 --> 00:13:47,360
用这铲子干了什么事吗 曼尼
did something with that shovel, Manny?

393
00:13:50,060 --> 00:13:51,360
他认为是你杀了那只狗
He thinks you killed the dog.

394
00:13:51,360 --> 00:13:52,560
你这鼠辈
You little rat.

395
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,660
别叫我老鼠
Don't call me a rat!

396
00:13:53,920 --> 00:13:55,480
她是灭鼠天后
She kills rats!

397
00:14:03,740 --> 00:14:05,900
你真的认为是我杀了那只狗吗
You really think that I would kill a dog?

398
00:14:06,020 --> 00:14:07,360
那我该怎么想
Well, what was I supposed to think?

399
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:08,260
我不知道
I don't know.

400
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:09,880
我没杀那只狗怎么样
How about I didn't kill a dog?

401
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:11,600
那就告诉我你把它怎么了
Just tell me what you did with it.

402
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,520
他去了一个更好的地方
He's in a better place.

403
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:15,440
人们说什么东西死了的时候都这么说
That's what people say when something's dead.

404
00:14:15,640 --> 00:14:16,340
好吧
Okay, fine.

405
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,740
我把它带去了一个农场
I took him to a farm

406
00:14:17,740 --> 00:14:19,740
那里地方很大任由它玩耍
where he has plenty of room to run.

407
00:14:19,740 --> 00:14:22,080
人们说什么东西死了的第二种表述方式
That's the second thing people say when something's dead.

408
00:14:23,420 --> 00:14:25,760
我专属美发师的兄弟有三个孩子
My hairdresser's brother has three kids.

409
00:14:26,060 --> 00:14:27,040
他们住在乡下
They live in the country.

410
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:28,860
他们很高兴拥有这只狗
They were so happy to have the dog

411
00:14:28,860 --> 00:14:30,620
还送给我们一瓶咸菜
that they gave me a jar of pickles.

412
00:14:30,860 --> 00:14:32,760
这也是人们说什么东西死了的一种方式吗
Is that also what they say when something is dead?

413
00:14:33,060 --> 00:14:33,360
真的吗
Really?

414
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,440
看 看看他们多么开心
Look. Look how happy they are,

415
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:39,540
而不是在这儿孤零零地
instead of him being tied to a tree outside

416
00:14:39,540 --> 00:14:41,060
被绑在外面的树上
with no one to talk to.

417
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:43,460
你怎么不一开始告诉我这些
Why didn't you just tell me this in the first place?

418
00:14:43,460 --> 00:14:45,600
就好像你不在意我偷一只狗似的
Like you would be okay with me stealing a dog?

419
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:46,900
-当然不行 -就是这样
- No. - Exactly.

420
00:14:46,920 --> 00:14:48,160
这就是我不告诉你的原因
That's why I didn't tell you.

421
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:50,400
现在狗狗开心 曼尼能安心睡觉
Now the dog is happy, Manny can sleep,

422
00:14:50,400 --> 00:14:51,340
而我们还有咸菜吃
and we have pickles.

423
00:14:51,500 --> 00:14:53,480
好的 这次的事就这么算了
Okay, it worked out this time,

424
00:14:53,519 --> 00:14:55,681
不过别忘了偷窃是违法的
but don't forget that stealing is against the law.

425
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:57,880
-也许在哥伦比亚 -又来了
- Now, maybe in Colombia. - Ah, here we go,

426
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:59,880
因为在哥伦比亚我们会被羊绊倒
because in Colombia we trip over goats

427
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:01,280
我们当街杀人
and we kill people in the street.

428
00:15:01,540 --> 00:15:03,720
你知道这有多伤人吗
Do you know how offensive that is?

429
00:15:03,759 --> 00:15:05,994
就好像我们是秘鲁人似的
Like we are Peruvians!

430
00:15:09,620 --> 00:15:11,360
这比赛太难熬了
The contest was hard.

431
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:12,820
预定
Reservations.

432
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,860
虽然我们发誓断绝网络
Even though we had sworn off the internet,

433
00:15:15,060 --> 00:15:16,520
但是外面的人没有
the rest of the world hadn't.

434
00:15:16,940 --> 00:15:17,420
奥兰多
Orlando.

435
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:19,760
国内的
Domestic.

436
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:23,400
代理人
Representative.

437
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:25,800
代理人
Representative!

438
00:15:26,560 --> 00:15:27,460
代理人 代理人
Representative! Representative!

439
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:35,980
你有一封邮件
You've got mail.

440
00:15:42,860 --> 00:15:44,680
-真的假的 克莱尔 -你不明白
- Really, Claire? - You don't understand.

441
00:15:44,780 --> 00:15:46,180
我正试着买机票
I was trying to deal with our plane tickets

442
00:15:46,180 --> 00:15:47,300
去拜访你的家人
to visit your family.

443
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:49,440
别说了 你这是自找难堪
Please stop. You're just embarrassing yourself.

444
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:51,880
巅峰对决 老头
Well, it looks like it's just you and me, old man.

445
00:15:52,260 --> 00:15:53,300
放马过来吧
Bring it.

446
00:15:57,380 --> 00:15:59,480
终于 我们逛回办公室了
And finally, here we are back at the office.

447
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:01,800
你们如果愿意坐一会的话
If you two would like to take a seat,

448
00:16:01,844 --> 00:16:03,594
我这就去通知普林普顿先生说你们到了
I will let Mr. Plympton know that you're here.

449
00:16:03,660 --> 00:16:05,540
-谢谢你 -好的 谢谢你
- Thank you. - Yes, thank you.

450
00:16:07,900 --> 00:16:09,340
这地方太赞了
This place is amazing!

451
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,320
我早就告诉你了
I told you.

452
00:16:10,380 --> 00:16:11,700
就像霍格沃茨一样
It's like Hogwarts!

453
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:13,520
瓢虫避难所
The ladybug sanctuary.

454
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:15,420
我的天啊 还有那些小鹅卵石
Oh, my gosh. The little cobblestones.

455
00:16:15,445 --> 00:16:16,061
太可爱了 我知道
So sweet. I know.

456
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:18,440
去他的鸭鸭吧 我们属于这里
Screw the duckies. We belong here.

457
00:16:18,475 --> 00:16:20,197
你觉得他们会收我们吗
Do you think they're gonna let us in?

458
00:16:20,220 --> 00:16:21,080
小卡 放松一下
Cam, relax.

459
00:16:21,180 --> 00:16:22,620
基佬就是好 学校任我挑
We're queer, we're here.

460
00:16:22,860 --> 00:16:23,600
没错 对极了
Yes, we are.

461
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:26,080
好了 再等几分钟
Okay. Just a few more minutes.

462
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:26,740
谢谢
Thank you.

463
00:16:26,860 --> 00:16:27,660
是的 谢谢
Yes, thank you.

464
00:16:27,696 --> 00:16:30,501
你好 我是斯蒂芬妮·卡莱尔
Hi. I'm Stephanie Kaner.

465
00:16:30,549 --> 00:16:31,910
这是加佛
And this is Javar.

466
00:16:32,585 --> 00:16:34,740
我们和普林普顿先生约好有个面试
We have an interview with Mr. Plympton.

467
00:16:34,799 --> 00:16:36,433
真好 这两位先来 你是下一个
Wonderful. These two are first. You'll be next.

468
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:38,100
单身白人母亲 黑人小孩
Single white mother, black child.

469
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:38,600
那又怎样
So what?

470
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:39,960
莉莉是亚洲宝宝 我们是基佬
Lily's asian. We're gay.

471
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,520
在这场入学扑克赛中
In the school admissions poker game,

472
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:42,780
我们可是一手好牌
we're the winning hand.

473
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:44,900
亲爱的 不好意思
Oh, honey, sorry.

474
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:46,360
这是我的伴侣卡维塔
My partner Kavita.

475
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:47,880
你好 很高兴见到你
Hi. Nice to meet you.

476
00:16:47,900 --> 00:16:49,060
你好 很高兴见到你
Hello. Nice to meet you.

477
00:16:49,099 --> 00:16:50,941
再等几分钟
It will be just a few minutes.

478
00:16:50,980 --> 00:16:54,160
跨种族的残疾拉拉带着一个非洲娃娃
Disabled interracial lesbians with an african kicker.

479
00:16:54,260 --> 00:16:55,580
始料未及
Did not see that coming.

480
00:16:57,580 --> 00:17:00,080
我已经有段时间没看纸质报纸了
It's been a while since I read an actual newspaper.

481
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,751
真怀念那声音啊
Miss that sound.

482
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:09,360
-不会吧 不会吧 -怎么啦
- No, no, no, no! - What is it?

483
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:10,360
布拉德受伤了
Brady's injured.

484
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:12,360
别这样啊 他是整支队伍的灵魂人物
No! He's my whole team.

485
00:17:12,360 --> 00:17:13,540
看来我得修改队员名单了
I have to change my roster.

486
00:17:13,540 --> 00:17:15,260
亲爱的 如果你在电话上不能搞定的话
Honey, if you can't do it over the phone,

487
00:17:15,500 --> 00:17:17,740
这事你就搞不定了 我们可不会为海莉买车
You can't do it, because we're not buying Haley a car.

488
00:17:17,860 --> 00:17:19,280
-也是噢 -你明白就好
- Yeah. - Yeah.

489
00:17:19,540 --> 00:17:19,820
好吧
Yeah.

490
00:17:19,820 --> 00:17:21,240
那么
Well...

491
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:24,300
我还是去浴室待着好了
Well, I'm just gonna go to the bathroom.

492
00:17:29,405 --> 00:17:31,600
菲尔·邓菲 你休想这样做
Phil Dunphy, don't you even dream of it.

493
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:33,020
克莱尔 我所有的朋友都在那个联赛里
Claire, all my friends are in that league.

494
00:17:33,020 --> 00:17:34,600
-别人会以为我傻呢 -那又怎么样
- I'm gonna like an idiot. - So what?

495
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:36,400
我可是支付了高额的入会费
So I paid a huge entrance fee.

496
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:38,280
-有多高额 -也不是很高 一点点而已
- How huge? - Not huge. Tiny.

497
00:17:40,020 --> 00:17:42,960
我的天哪 什么事情把她乐成这样
Oh, my goodness. How is she not cracking up there?

498
00:17:43,580 --> 00:17:44,600
瞧她乐的
Listen to her.

499
00:17:44,646 --> 00:17:47,086
不 我知道 不过你知道吗
No, I know, but do you know?

500
00:17:47,121 --> 00:17:49,165
等等 她一个人待着呢
Wait a minute. She's alone.

501
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:49,500
然后呢
So?

502
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:52,240
她一个人待着呢
She's alone.

503
00:17:52,700 --> 00:17:53,540
娘亲噢
Oh, my god.

504
00:17:56,660 --> 00:17:58,640
我知道 你真该看看她的短裤
I know. You should see her pants.

505
00:17:58,840 --> 00:18:00,300
我用彩信发给你好了
I'll text it to you.

506
00:18:00,880 --> 00:18:03,500
好的 等等 别挂 我会发给你的
Oh, wait. Okay. Hold on. I'll send it.

507
00:18:03,563 --> 00:18:07,678
噢耶 被逮着了吧
Ha! Aha! Aha! Busted!

508
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:09,320
索菲 我等会儿再打给你
Sophie, I have to call you back.

509
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:11,320
我就知道 我就知道你没法做到
I knew it. I knew you couldn't do it.

510
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,960
我告诉你我肯定笑到最后
I told you I'd outlast them.

511
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,760
-真没劲 -这是怎么了
- This sucks! - What's going on?

512
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:16,200
我来告诉你这是怎么了
I'll tell you what's going on.

513
00:18:16,660 --> 00:18:17,280
爷赢了
I win.

514
00:18:18,040 --> 00:18:20,460
汽车泡汤了 我得把汤姆·布拉德抛售了
Nobody gets a car, I dump Tom Brady,

515
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:23,840
长时间困扰我们的噩梦终结了
and our long amish nightmare is over.

516
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,840
我真的不敢相信
I can't believe you thought

517
00:18:25,840 --> 00:18:27,860
你居然以为能战胜我们
you were gonna put one over on us.

518
00:18:27,980 --> 00:18:29,160
我也不敢相信
I can't believe

519
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:31,600
他居然已经在上网了
that he's actually already on the internet.

520
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:32,660
认栽吧 孩子
Believe it, girl.

521
00:18:32,900 --> 00:18:35,320
-你现在真的在上网吗 -是滴
- So, you're actually online right now? - Yep.

522
00:18:36,300 --> 00:18:38,460
很好 那我不得不很遗憾地告诉你 老爹
Well, then I hate to break it to you, daddy,

523
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,780
你输了
but you lose.

524
00:18:40,846 --> 00:18:43,260
-什么 -什么
- What? - What?

525
00:18:43,260 --> 00:18:44,340
这才不是我的手机呢
This isn't my phone.

526
00:18:44,740 --> 00:18:46,200
是我用一块肥皂刻成的
I carved it out of a bar of soap

527
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:47,820
然后又用记号笔给它上色
and colored it in with a marker.

528
00:18:49,460 --> 00:18:52,060
菲尔 她居然用一块肥皂刻了部手机出来
Phil, she carved a telephone out of a bar of soap.

529
00:18:52,060 --> 00:18:55,211
太激动鸟 我就要有车啦
I can't believe it! I'm getting a car!

530
00:18:55,654 --> 00:18:58,384
真扯淡 我们居然被忽悠了一把
Holy crap. We've been shawshanked.

531
00:19:02,060 --> 00:19:03,300
抱歉来晚了
Sorry about the delay.

532
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:06,400
因为新舞蹈室的规划一事耽误了
I was going over the plans for our new dance studio.

533
00:19:06,437 --> 00:19:08,280
真棒
Wow.

534
00:19:08,280 --> 00:19:09,860
那么 你们先自我介绍下吧
So, tell me about yourselves.

535
00:19:09,892 --> 00:19:13,788
好的 我是一名律师
Uh, well, I'm a lawyer.

536
00:19:13,820 --> 00:19:15,240
我们的申请人中有很多律师
Many of our applicants are attorneys.

537
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:15,840
当然
Of course.

538
00:19:16,260 --> 00:19:17,060
你有什么出众的地方吗
What sets you apart?

539
00:19:17,091 --> 00:19:18,885
我 我
Um, well, I --

540
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:22,060
我的白人名字叫塔克
While my white-man name is Tucker,

541
00:19:22,088 --> 00:19:25,260
我有16分之一的彻罗基族血统
I am 1/16 Cherokee.

542
00:19:25,260 --> 00:19:29,240
期望着孩子像雄鹰一般展翅高飞
Ready for child to soar like eagle.

543
00:19:30,300 --> 00:19:30,860
我的天哪
Oh, god.

544
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:34,660
你们是怎么个说法
So, what are you saying?

545
00:19:36,620 --> 00:19:38,000
你得不到汽车
You're not getting a car.

546
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:38,780
但是我赢了啊
But I won.

547
00:19:38,780 --> 00:19:40,860
是的 但是我们之前从未想过你居然会赢
Yes, but we never thought you would.

548
00:19:41,320 --> 00:19:41,540
然后呢
So?

549
00:19:41,900 --> 00:19:44,460
然后 恭喜你的胜利
So, congratulations on your victory.

550
00:19:44,540 --> 00:19:46,400
没人能夺走这份荣誉
Nobody can ever take that away from you.

551
00:19:46,435 --> 00:19:47,003
言之有理
So true. Mm-hmm.

552
00:19:47,020 --> 00:19:49,420
可是我在房间里
But I spent two days in my room

553
00:19:49,420 --> 00:19:51,540
对着块肥皂自言自语了两天啊
talking to a bar of soap.

554
00:19:51,860 --> 00:19:52,720
这不公平
It's not fair.

555
00:19:52,820 --> 00:19:54,220
一点都不公平
It's totally not fair.

556
00:19:54,220 --> 00:19:55,599
我们也义愤填膺
We're outraged.

557
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:56,040
我们不是好父母
Bad parenting.

558
00:19:56,780 --> 00:19:58,240
可我们之前说好的啊
But we had a deal.

559
00:19:58,600 --> 00:20:01,140
事后诸葛亮 事前猪一样
Which, in hindsight, was utter nonsense.

560
00:20:02,180 --> 00:20:02,780
你们好啊
Hey.

561
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:04,660
我们讨厌比林斯利
We hated Billingsley.

562
00:20:04,692 --> 00:20:06,280
那地方简直愚蠢至极
The place is so stupid. Ugh!

563
00:20:06,960 --> 00:20:08,200
面试泡汤的是吧
You blew the interview, didn't you?

564
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:09,820
杀出一对拉拉
Lesbians.

565
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,400
其中一个还坐轮椅
In a wheelchair.

566
00:20:11,421 --> 00:20:12,725
不会吧
Oh.

567
00:20:17,540 --> 00:20:18,600
你还生我气呢
You still mad at me?

568
00:20:18,760 --> 00:20:19,680
你说呢
You tell me.

569
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:22,000
这是什么
What is this?

570
00:20:22,100 --> 00:20:23,960
我在想 我一直在诋毁哥伦比亚
I've been thinking if you said as much about America

571
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:26,040
如果你也像我那样诋毁美国 我早就气冒烟了
as I said about Colombia, I'd be plenty ticked off.

572
00:20:26,340 --> 00:20:27,780
这弥补不了什么 只是
Doesn't make up for everything, but...

573
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:29,640
去哥伦比亚的旅行
A trip to Colombia?

574
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:31,300
我想看看你们的村庄 学习下你们的文化
I want to see your village, learn your culture.

575
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:32,820
我爱你
I love you.

576
00:20:32,820 --> 00:20:34,604
毫无疑问无论你来自哪里我都爱你
I'm sure I'm gonna love where you come from.

577
00:20:34,604 --> 00:20:37,680
杰 谢谢 谢谢 谢谢
Aw, Jay. Thank you, thank you, thank you.

578
00:20:39,560 --> 00:20:41,680
他想去我的村庄 没门
No way he's going to my village.

579
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:44,720
我住在那的时候出过两次车祸
I was in two car accidents when I was living there.

580
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:46,240
两次都是撞上了一只山羊
Both times I hit a goat.

581
00:20:46,500 --> 00:20:47,840
其中一次还伤得挺重
One was hurt pretty bad.

582
00:20:47,880 --> 00:20:50,240
不过好在我后备箱里放着把铲子
But it was a good thing I had a shovel in the trunk.

583
00:20:52,699 --> 00:20:55,484
族长预言过
The tribe builter fortold that

584
00:20:57,280 --> 00:21:00,780
虽然我会与金毛男结合
though I lay with fire-haired man,

585
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:04,560
送子雄鹰会给我们
the giving hawk would bring us baby

586
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:08,740
玉米色肌肤的孩子
with her skin the color of sweet corn,

587
00:21:09,200 --> 00:21:11,860
我们的族人称之为黄金之子
which my people call maize.

588
00:21:12,460 --> 00:21:13,540
快别说了
Please stop.

589
00:21:14,140 --> 00:21:14,900
好吧
Well, um...

590
00:21:14,900 --> 00:21:17,720
知识就是她的养料
Knowledge is her sustenance,

591
00:21:18,340 --> 00:21:20,760
就像那么多的玉米
like so much maize --

592
00:21:20,840 --> 00:21:24,840
玉米这个词你应该记得住吧
which, you'll remember, means "Corn."

593
00:21:25,440 --> 00:21:26,800
如果我是个单身父亲呢
What if I was a single dad?
